WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
The studio hub: four corridors, one per genre

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Color-coded corridors lead to each room

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
A counter tracks the hidden Golden Records

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
Country room: a saloon with live like boards

00:32.000 --> 00:44.000
The red Encore pad fires confetti for the whole room

00:44.000 --> 00:52.000
Back through the hub

00:52.000 --> 01:10.000
Electronic room: dance floor, lasers and arcade cabinets

01:10.000 --> 01:24.000
On to the Rock room

01:24.000 --> 01:34.000
Click an artist to like them

01:34.000 --> 01:42.000
Likes re-rank the All-Time Four frames

01:42.000 --> 01:52.000
Encore in the Rock room

01:52.000 --> 02:04.000
Heading to Hip-Hop

02:04.000 --> 02:22.000
Hip-Hop room: DJ riser, All-Time Four and like boards

02:22.000 --> 02:30.000
Record shop and the way back to the studio

02:30.000 --> 02:43.000
Back in the hub: find the hidden Golden Records
